   alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"11610\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/11609/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/11609/11609.avif\"\n         title=\"Campus Lights 15\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"11609\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cdiv class=\"diptych\"\u003e\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/11901/\"\u003e\n\t\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/11901/11901.avif\"\n\t         title=\"Campus Lights 16\"\n\t         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t\t id=\"11901\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n\t    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/11902/\"\u003e\n\t\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/11902/11902.avif\"\n\t         title=\"Campus Lights 17\"\n\t         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t\t width=\"999\"\n\t\t\t id=\"11902\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n\t    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/11707/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/11707/11707.avif\"\n         title=\"Campus Lights 18\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"11707\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/11611/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/11611/11611.avif\"\n         title=\"Campus Lights 19\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"11611\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/11907/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/11907/11907.avif\"\n         title=\"Campus Lights 20\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"999\"\n\t\t id=\"11907\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/11912/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/11912/11912.avif\"\n         title=\"Campus Lights 21\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"11912\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/11703/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/11703/11703.avif\"\n         title=\"Campus Lights 22\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"11703\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/12211/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/12211/12211.avif\"\n         title=\"Campus Lights 23\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"999\"\n\t\t width=\"999\"\n\t\t id=\"12211\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\n\n\n\u003cfigure\u003e\n\t\u003ca href=\"/photos/11606/\"\u003e\n\t\u003cimg src=\"/photos/11606/11606.avif\"\n         title=\"Campus Lights 24\"\n         alt=\"TODO alt text\"\n\t\t height=\"1000\"\n\t\t width=\"1000\"\n\t\t id=\"11606\" loading=\"lazy\"  fetchpriority=\"auto\" /\u003e \n    \u003c/a\u003e\n\t\u003c/figure\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThis series was shot on my Hasselblad 500C/M with 150mm CF lens and Rollei CR200\nfilm, developed by Palm Labs in Birmingham and scanned with my Epson 4180.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch2 id=\"references\"\u003eReferences\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca name=\"ref1\"\nhref=\"https://books.google.co.uk/books?id=dEEGtAtR1NcC\u0026lpg=PR5\"\u003eCatherine Rich,\nTravis Longcore. Ecological consequences of artifical night lighting. Island\nPress 2006\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003ca name=\"ref2\"\nhref=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC2627884/\"\u003eRon Chepesiuk.\nMissing the dark: health effects of light pollution. Environ Health Perspect.\n2009 Jan; 117(1): A20-A27\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e",
